---
import SealAnatomy3D from '../visualizers/SealAnatomy3D.astro';
import HandshakeVisualizer from '../visualizers/HandshakeVisualizer.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 lg:py-32 bg-[#090C12] border-t border-b border-slate-800/80 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#D4AF37]/10 text-[#F5D77F] font-mono text-xs mb-4 border border-[#D4AF37]/30">
        Constitution & Identity • Founded Nov 27, 1984
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-display font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">
        The Essence of <span class="gold-gradient-text">SAM-UP</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-light">
        Realizing the vital necessity for an organized body to promote the relevance of Applied Mathematics to Philippine Society and advance national progress through quantitative mastery.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Core Philosophy: Triad of Excellence -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-20">
      <!-- Pillar 1: Prestige -->
      <div class="glass-panel glass-panel-hover rounded-3xl p-8 border border-[#D4AF37]/20 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/20 to-amber-900/40 border border-[#D4AF37]/40 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-[#D4AF37]/10">
            🏆
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3">Prestige</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Cultivating an unyielding standard of academic excellence. Our members continuously lead university honor rolls, earn centennial professorial chairs, and champion national mathematical olympiads.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 text-xs font-mono text-[#F5D77F]">
          #TatakSAMUP Academic Rigor
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 2: Service -->
      <div class="glass-panel glass-panel-hover rounded-3xl p-8 border border-[#D4AF37]/20 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/20 to-emerald-900/40 border border-emerald-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/10">
            🇵🇭
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3">Service</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Rooted in the belief that the university is a microcosm of a larger nation. We leverage mathematical models, epidemiological forecasting, and community tutorial networks for social good.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400">
          Applied Math for National Progress
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 3: Leadership -->
      <div class="glass-panel glass-panel-hover rounded-3xl p-8 border border-[#D4AF37]/20 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/20 to-blue-900/40 border border-blue-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/10">
            ⭐
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3">Leadership</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Practicing collective leadership and rigorous self-criticism. Forging quantitative innovators who transition seamlessly from the UPLB Math Building into industry, research, and governance.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 text-xs font-mono text-blue-400">
          #BeyondSAMUP Mentorship
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The Inviolate Principles Box (Article III) -->
    <div class="p-8 lg:p-12 rounded-3xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl mb-24 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#D4AF37] uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">Constitutional Principles</span>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-display font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">
          The Five Pillars of Organizational Faith
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[#D4AF37] font-bold">01.</span>
            <span>The Organization believes that the <strong>University is a microcosm of a larger society</strong>.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[#D4AF37] font-bold">02.</span>
            <span>The Organization believes in absolute <strong>Equality, Unity, Loyalty, and Commitment</strong>.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[#D4AF37] font-bold">03.</span>
            <span>The Organization believes in <strong>Collective Leadership</strong> and constructive criticism and self-criticism.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section Subheading: Emblem Symbology -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
      <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-bold text-slate-100 mb-2">
        Anatomy of the Official Seal
      </h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
        Article II: Color and Emblem specifications codified since 1984.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive Seal Anatomy Breakdown Component -->
    <div class="mb-24">
      <SealAnatomy3D />
    </div>

    <!-- Section Subheading: Handshake Symbology -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
      <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-bold text-slate-100 mb-2">
        The Left-Hand Handshake
      </h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
        Article V: The sacred grip symbolizing the unbreakable bond of all objectives.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive Handshake Visualizer Component -->
    <div>
      <HandshakeVisualizer />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
